// KNOWN LIMITATION: "wildcard exhale of a quantified permission across
// several holders". A wildcard exhale takes from a single covering chunk set
// only; here two single chunks cover it together
// (`plans/wildcard-quantified-permissions.md`, phase 4).
//
// Should VERIFY.
field f: Int

method wildcard_exhale_across_holders(a: Ref, b: Ref)
  requires acc(a.f) && acc(b.f)
{
  exhale forall x: Ref :: x in Set(a, b) ==> acc(x.f, wildcard)
}
